lingmo-filemanager (5.0.9+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * desktop: fix icons cannot be dragged to new positions. In desktop
    mode, dragUpdate now forces MoveAction while the model is dragging so
    the compositor accepts the drop and routes it to move.emit (rearrange)
    rather than file-copy.
  * desktop: fix icon corner setting has no effect on where new icons
    appear. Positioner::defaultCell now respects the corner (TopRight /
    TopLeft / BottomLeft / BottomRight): right-side corners fill from the
    last stripe inward, bottom corners fill from the bottom of each stripe.
    DesktopGridView::setIconCorner propagates the corner to the positioner.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0800

lingmo-filemanager (5.0.8+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * desktop: add icon corner setting; new icons appear at the chosen
    corner of the work area (Top Right / Top Left / Bottom Left /
    Bottom Right). Exposed via a SetIconCorner D-Bus method and persisted
    to Desktop/iconCorner in filemanager.conf.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 13:00:00 +0800

lingmo-filemanager (5.0.7+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * desktop: add View and Sort By submenus to the background right-click
    menu. View provides Large/Medium/Small icon sizes (with checkmark on
    the active size), Auto Arrange Icons, Align Icons to Grid, and Show
    Desktop Icons. Sort By offers Name, Size, Item Type and Modified Date
    (with checkmark on the active sort). Selections are persisted in
    filemanager.conf under Desktop/iconSize, Desktop/showIcons,
    Desktop/autoArrange and Desktop/sortMode.

